1
00:01:05,300 --> 00:01:08,940
=When the Lights Rise=
=Episode 14=

2
00:01:32,380 --> 00:01:33,180
Who's there?

3
00:01:37,780 --> 00:01:38,700
Yue?

4
00:01:40,220 --> 00:01:41,580
Why aren't you asleep at this hour?

5
00:01:41,860 --> 00:01:43,060
What's gotten into you?

6
00:01:46,020 --> 00:01:47,980
I remember when I gave birth to Yijie,

7
00:01:48,860 --> 00:01:49,940
I suffered severe bleeding

8
00:01:50,700 --> 00:01:52,060
and was unconscious for several days.

9
00:01:56,180 --> 00:01:57,740
That was so many years ago.

10
00:01:58,020 --> 00:01:59,780
Why bring it up again?

11
00:02:01,220 --> 00:02:02,420
I don't know why,

12
00:02:03,620 --> 00:02:05,620
but I keep feeling
I gave birth to twins.

13
00:02:07,060 --> 00:02:08,260
Yet when I woke up,

14
00:02:09,380 --> 00:02:11,020
everyone told me

15
00:02:11,420 --> 00:02:12,780
I'd only had one child.

16
00:02:19,820 --> 00:02:20,940
You

17
00:02:21,860 --> 00:02:23,540
must be upset
by everything that's happened.

18
00:02:24,180 --> 00:02:25,180
Don't worry.

19
00:02:25,780 --> 00:02:28,740
I'll arrange the best doctors for Yijie.

20
00:02:30,820 --> 00:02:32,380
The scar on Mei Xiaozhu's waist

21
00:02:33,580 --> 00:02:35,260
is identical to Yijie's.

22
00:02:37,820 --> 00:02:38,460
At this hour,

23
00:02:38,460 --> 00:02:39,580
what nonsense are you talking about?

24
00:02:39,820 --> 00:02:40,860
That's ridiculous.

25
00:02:40,980 --> 00:02:41,460
Enough.

26
00:02:41,460 --> 00:02:42,180
Go back to bed.

27
00:02:42,180 --> 00:02:42,500
Go on.

28
00:02:42,500 --> 00:02:44,060
Last month, on Yijie's birthday,

29
00:02:44,980 --> 00:02:46,380
he said he wanted
to invite a girl from his class

30
00:02:46,380 --> 00:02:47,300
over to the house.

31
00:02:49,580 --> 00:02:50,260
When she arrives,

32
00:02:50,260 --> 00:02:51,260
have her sit here.

33
00:02:52,300 --> 00:02:53,660
Replace this tea set.

34
00:02:53,820 --> 00:02:55,940
Bring out
the one we bought in England last year.

35
00:02:56,820 --> 00:02:58,980
Oh, and the fruit.

36
00:02:59,420 --> 00:03:00,340
For her portion,

37
00:03:00,420 --> 00:03:01,540
don't include any mangoes either.

38
00:03:01,540 --> 00:03:02,220
Yes.

39
00:03:05,940 --> 00:03:06,740
Yijie,

40
00:03:07,020 --> 00:03:08,140
you're putting
so much thought into this.

41
00:03:08,460 --> 00:03:10,740
Which family's
young lady has caught your eye?

42
00:03:10,780 --> 00:03:11,580
Grandfather.

43
00:03:15,300 --> 00:03:16,340
What?

44
00:03:17,300 --> 00:03:17,900
Absolutely not!

45
00:03:18,620 --> 00:03:19,980
The birthday celebration is canceled!

46
00:03:19,980 --> 00:03:21,460
Go back to your room!

47
00:03:21,820 --> 00:03:22,620
What's wrong?

48
00:03:23,020 --> 00:03:23,660
What did you say

49
00:03:23,660 --> 00:03:24,660
to upset your grandfather?

50
00:03:24,660 --> 00:03:26,260
Mom, I just...

51
00:03:26,260 --> 00:03:27,260
Be quiet!

52
00:03:27,900 --> 00:03:29,460
Are you trying to ruin this family?

53
00:03:35,820 --> 00:03:37,780
The person he wanted
to invite was Mei Xiaozhu.

54
00:03:39,660 --> 00:03:41,820
He wanted to bring
the sister he'd finally found

55
00:03:41,820 --> 00:03:43,060
home to reunite with her family.

56
00:03:43,060 --> 00:03:43,820
And you

57
00:03:46,020 --> 00:03:47,380
abandoned her all over again.

58
00:04:00,900 --> 00:04:04,300
So I couldn't
keep it from you after all.

59
00:04:06,180 --> 00:04:06,980
Yes.

60
00:04:09,180 --> 00:04:10,580
But so what?

61
00:04:15,820 --> 00:04:17,260
Why did you lie to me?

62
00:04:19,660 --> 00:04:21,540
Why did you abandon my daughter?

63
00:04:22,260 --> 00:04:23,740
Why did you kill her?

64
00:04:26,100 --> 00:04:27,420
I never should have agreed

65
00:04:27,420 --> 00:04:29,380
to let Dong Zhenglun
abandon her on the railroad tracks.

66
00:04:29,980 --> 00:04:31,900
I should have killed her myself

67
00:04:32,020 --> 00:04:33,220
and burned her body to ashes

68
00:04:33,220 --> 00:04:34,340
so she'd never be a problem again.

69
00:04:35,820 --> 00:04:37,940
She was just a newborn baby.

70
00:04:39,300 --> 00:04:41,340
She was your own flesh and blood.

71
00:04:42,420 --> 00:04:44,700
How could you hate her so much?

72
00:04:49,620 --> 00:04:50,420
If you want someone to blame,

73
00:04:51,700 --> 00:04:54,900
blame yourself for giving birth
to those ill-fated twins.

74
00:05:09,860 --> 00:05:13,100
What business is your family in?

75
00:05:14,220 --> 00:05:16,340
We run factories and sell cigarettes.

76
00:05:16,660 --> 00:05:17,500
That won't do.

77
00:05:17,660 --> 00:05:19,820
Twins will bring disaster,

78
00:05:20,100 --> 00:05:22,900
especially to a family in business.

79
00:05:23,820 --> 00:05:24,620
Yes.

80
00:05:24,900 --> 00:05:26,940
I've heard that before.

81
00:05:27,060 --> 00:05:30,380
That's why we came
to see you overnight, Master.

82
00:05:32,820 --> 00:05:34,060
The best thing to do

83
00:05:34,380 --> 00:05:36,020
is keep one child

84
00:05:36,020 --> 00:05:37,300
and send the other away.

85
00:05:37,820 --> 00:05:40,140
I'll examine the children's fortunes

86
00:05:40,780 --> 00:05:41,740
and calculate.

87
00:05:42,180 --> 00:05:42,980
Yes, of course.

88
00:05:49,700 --> 00:05:52,580
If you're determined to do this,

89
00:05:53,220 --> 00:05:54,820
you must be ruthless.

90
00:05:55,060 --> 00:05:57,740
If you're going
to send one away, do it for good.

91
00:05:58,580 --> 00:05:59,940
If the child remains alive,

92
00:06:00,020 --> 00:06:01,220
the child will resent you,

93
00:06:01,660 --> 00:06:04,020
and your family
will face even more unrest.

94
00:06:06,900 --> 00:06:07,900
Understood. Understood.

95
00:06:07,900 --> 00:06:10,060
We'll do whatever you say, Master.

96
00:06:12,320 --> 00:06:18,000
(Birth Date and Time)

97
00:06:19,660 --> 00:06:20,780
For this birth time,

98
00:06:21,900 --> 00:06:24,500
the girl has the better fortune.

99
00:06:32,820 --> 00:06:33,340
Dad.

100
00:06:34,060 --> 00:06:34,940
I'll listen to you.

101
00:06:35,180 --> 00:06:35,980
You decide.

102
00:06:44,380 --> 00:06:46,260
If you want to keep your grandson,

103
00:06:46,460 --> 00:06:47,260
that's possible too.

104
00:06:48,020 --> 00:06:50,660
But you'll have to perform
life swapping on the twins.

105
00:06:51,220 --> 00:06:52,460
Doing so, however,

106
00:06:53,220 --> 00:06:54,940
will shorten my lifespan.

107
00:06:58,580 --> 00:07:00,420
Please accept this, Master.

108
00:07:01,100 --> 00:07:02,740
How do we perform life swapping?

109
00:07:02,900 --> 00:07:03,700
Yes.

110
00:07:12,980 --> 00:07:15,260
Master, as long as
we can keep our grandson,

111
00:07:15,980 --> 00:07:17,500
we'll do whatever it takes.

112
00:07:17,740 --> 00:07:18,140
That's right.

113
00:07:18,420 --> 00:07:18,900
Yes.

114
00:07:50,420 --> 00:07:51,180
Go on.

115
00:07:51,420 --> 00:07:52,700
Handle it yourselves.

116
00:07:53,300 --> 00:07:54,900
If someone dies here,

117
00:07:55,140 --> 00:07:56,900
it will disrupt
the feng shui and fortune of this place.

118
00:07:58,820 --> 00:07:59,580
We'll do as you say, Master.

119
00:08:08,540 --> 00:08:09,980
Thank you, Master.

120
00:08:32,740 --> 00:08:34,340
Just because someone
said they were unlucky?

121
00:08:37,380 --> 00:08:39,740
That was a living, breathing child!

122
00:08:39,740 --> 00:08:41,740
How could you bring yourselves to do it?

123
00:08:47,260 --> 00:08:48,740
What family bonds?

124
00:08:49,540 --> 00:08:51,060
What flesh and blood?

125
00:08:51,180 --> 00:08:53,220
None of that matters to you
more than your business,

126
00:08:53,220 --> 00:08:53,540
does it?

127
00:08:53,540 --> 00:08:54,820
At least you understand.

128
00:08:56,980 --> 00:08:58,380
The Kuang family
has no room for useless people.

129
00:08:58,880 --> 00:09:00,300
What you should do now

130
00:09:01,020 --> 00:09:02,340
is take good care of Yijie

131
00:09:02,580 --> 00:09:03,780
and stop causing me trouble.

132
00:09:43,620 --> 00:09:44,260
Miss Mei.

133
00:09:45,900 --> 00:09:47,300
Did you ask Mrs. Kuang?

134
00:09:48,700 --> 00:09:49,540
Xiaozhu...

135
00:09:55,380 --> 00:09:56,900
She finally found her family.

136
00:09:58,940 --> 00:10:00,260
She finally had a home.

137
00:10:07,180 --> 00:10:08,660
Xiaozhu always had a home.

138
00:10:10,260 --> 00:10:11,700
You were her family.

139
00:10:13,420 --> 00:10:14,780
If she could choose,

140
00:10:15,580 --> 00:10:18,660
she would certainly
want to live with you.

141
00:10:25,420 --> 00:10:26,580
Once Mrs. Kuang arrives,

142
00:10:26,700 --> 00:10:27,420
I'll leave.

143
00:10:29,300 --> 00:10:30,260
I can't continue

144
00:10:31,540 --> 00:10:32,900
investigating this case.

145
00:10:34,500 --> 00:10:36,740
What about the missing girls
Kuang Yijie was investigating?

146
00:10:36,900 --> 00:10:37,780
Are you giving up on them?

147
00:10:39,340 --> 00:10:40,980
I'm just a tailor.

148
00:10:41,860 --> 00:10:42,900
What can I possibly do?

149
00:10:47,580 --> 00:10:49,140
As for what your sister did,

150
00:10:50,500 --> 00:10:52,820
I'm no longer
in a position to demand answers.

151
00:10:54,340 --> 00:10:55,860
That's between you and the Kuang family.

152
00:10:56,540 --> 00:10:57,580
Settle it yourselves.

153
00:10:58,300 --> 00:10:59,020
Miss Mei.

154
00:11:00,460 --> 00:11:01,460
You can't go in.

155
00:11:01,460 --> 00:11:01,980
Move aside.

156
00:11:01,980 --> 00:11:04,020
Visiting hours are over.

157
00:11:04,460 --> 00:11:05,220
Who are you?

158
00:11:05,220 --> 00:11:06,940
What are you doing barging
into a patient's room at this hour?

159
00:11:10,180 --> 00:11:11,580
I thought visitors weren't allowed.

160
00:11:11,940 --> 00:11:15,140
Then why is this room so crowded?

161
00:11:16,420 --> 00:11:18,380
Miss Mei is staying
at Mrs. Kuang's request

162
00:11:18,420 --> 00:11:19,860
to look after the young master.

163
00:11:20,140 --> 00:11:21,140
I'm here on behalf of Boss Ren

164
00:11:21,220 --> 00:11:21,860
to check on him.

165
00:11:21,980 --> 00:11:22,660
Is there a problem?

166
00:11:24,660 --> 00:11:25,980
Now that I'm here,

167
00:11:26,660 --> 00:11:29,340
the rest of you can leave.

168
00:11:29,580 --> 00:11:30,540
I promised Mrs. Kuang

169
00:11:30,900 --> 00:11:32,300
I wouldn't leave until she arrived.

170
00:11:32,740 --> 00:11:33,620
Get out of my way.

171
00:11:35,140 --> 00:11:35,660
You...

172
00:11:36,380 --> 00:11:37,220
Master Kuang.

173
00:11:37,620 --> 00:11:38,540
Instead of wasting your time here,

174
00:11:38,540 --> 00:11:39,860
you should be looking for Lv Mengde.

175
00:11:40,340 --> 00:11:41,860
Whether Lv Mengde is alive or dead

176
00:11:41,980 --> 00:11:43,820
affects the Kuang family's business.

177
00:11:45,580 --> 00:11:46,980
What a joke!

178
00:11:47,100 --> 00:11:48,220
You little brat!

179
00:11:48,540 --> 00:11:49,260
Have you forgotten

180
00:11:49,260 --> 00:11:50,620
your sister is still at my house?

181
00:11:50,860 --> 00:11:53,100
What matters most
is the Kuang family heir, isn't it?

182
00:11:53,380 --> 00:11:55,500
As long as that child hasn't been born,

183
00:11:56,100 --> 00:11:58,460
my sister will be safe.

184
00:11:58,820 --> 00:11:59,980
Isn't that right, Master Kuang?

185
00:12:04,060 --> 00:12:04,740
Li.

186
00:12:05,660 --> 00:12:06,860
- You can't!
- No!

187
00:12:07,140 --> 00:12:08,100
He's still receiving treatment.

188
00:12:08,100 --> 00:12:08,780
You can't take him away.

189
00:12:08,780 --> 00:12:10,420
I'll find him the best doctors.

190
00:12:10,700 --> 00:12:12,220
We won't need your help anymore.

191
00:12:12,620 --> 00:12:13,740
Take Yijie home!

192
00:12:13,740 --> 00:12:14,340
Move aside!

193
00:12:14,340 --> 00:12:15,540
- What are you doing?
- You can't take him!

194
00:12:15,540 --> 00:12:16,500
- Move!
- Don't touch him!

195
00:12:16,500 --> 00:12:17,620
- You can't!
- You can't!

196
00:12:17,620 --> 00:12:18,420
Get out of the way!

197
00:12:18,420 --> 00:12:19,100
You can't!

198
00:12:19,100 --> 00:12:19,820
Get out!

199
00:12:19,820 --> 00:12:22,220
Since you insist on keeping Yijie here,

200
00:12:22,220 --> 00:12:23,780
I'll have to get rid of her.

201
00:12:23,830 --> 00:12:24,820
What are you doing?

202
00:12:25,460 --> 00:12:26,260
Xiaozhu!

203
00:12:28,950 --> 00:12:29,680
Miss Mei!

204
00:12:37,420 --> 00:12:38,740
What are you waiting for? Do it!

205
00:12:38,740 --> 00:12:39,820
Touch her and see what happens.

206
00:12:39,820 --> 00:12:40,260
Wait!

207
00:12:40,740 --> 00:12:41,540
Dr. Bai.

208
00:12:41,820 --> 00:12:43,820
Call my colleagues
at the police station now.

209
00:12:44,220 --> 00:12:46,620
Tell them someone's abducting
a patient in the French Concession.

210
00:12:46,740 --> 00:12:47,260
All right.

211
00:12:48,820 --> 00:12:49,860
The police?

212
00:12:50,100 --> 00:12:51,060
I forgot to tell you.

213
00:12:51,220 --> 00:12:53,820
I'm now a Chinese detective inspector
with the police.

214
00:12:54,380 --> 00:12:56,940
You'd better take good care of Yiyi.

215
00:12:57,260 --> 00:12:59,730
Otherwise, your family's tobacco shops

216
00:12:59,730 --> 00:13:01,420
and illegal weapons smuggling business

217
00:13:02,020 --> 00:13:03,740
will be reported to the authorities.

218
00:13:13,100 --> 00:13:14,020
Xiaozhu.

219
00:13:15,460 --> 00:13:16,980
I'm so sorry.

220
00:13:17,700 --> 00:13:18,740
I'm sorry, Xiaozhu.

221
00:13:24,940 --> 00:13:26,260
I failed to protect you.

222
00:13:28,420 --> 00:13:30,660
I couldn't protect you, Xiaozhu.

223
00:13:31,740 --> 00:13:34,100
Xiaozhu, I'm sorry.

224
00:13:34,820 --> 00:13:36,060
I'm so sorry.

225
00:13:37,100 --> 00:13:37,540
Xiaozhu.

226
00:13:37,660 --> 00:13:38,460
Miss Mei.

227
00:13:38,820 --> 00:13:39,780
This isn't your fault.

228
00:13:39,980 --> 00:13:41,180
You've already done so much for her.

229
00:13:42,300 --> 00:13:43,380
You gave her a new life.

230
00:13:43,380 --> 00:13:44,460
Leave me alone.

231
00:13:49,900 --> 00:13:50,580
Miss Mei.

232
00:13:51,060 --> 00:13:53,500
Tomorrow, I'll have someone
bring this rosebush home for you.

233
00:13:53,780 --> 00:13:54,740
Take good care of it.

234
00:13:55,180 --> 00:13:55,820
Nurture it

235
00:13:56,300 --> 00:13:58,140
just as you once cared for Xiaozhu.

236
00:13:58,580 --> 00:13:59,260
All right?

237
00:14:06,540 --> 00:14:07,420
Miss Mei.

238
00:14:28,500 --> 00:14:28,980
Miss Mei.

239
00:15:07,840 --> 00:15:10,240
(St. Luke's Hospital)

240
00:15:29,700 --> 00:15:31,100
I'm sorry, Mrs. Kuang.

241
00:15:31,940 --> 00:15:33,670
I failed to look after Xiaozhu.

242
00:15:34,100 --> 00:15:34,840
And she ended up...

243
00:15:35,500 --> 00:15:36,820
I know what happened.

244
00:15:37,980 --> 00:15:39,060
You can't be blamed for this.

245
00:15:41,700 --> 00:15:43,460
Xiaozhu loved the sunshine.

246
00:15:44,260 --> 00:15:45,660
She loved flowers and plants too.

247
00:15:46,980 --> 00:15:47,740
I think

248
00:15:48,180 --> 00:15:50,140
perhaps this was her choice as well.

249
00:16:00,220 --> 00:16:01,740
I don't deserve to care for her.

250
00:16:03,380 --> 00:16:06,060
Please take her home, Miss Mei.

251
00:16:06,100 --> 00:16:06,710
Madam.

252
00:16:09,180 --> 00:16:11,660
Her father and grandfather

253
00:16:12,610 --> 00:16:14,500
did terrible things to her.

254
00:16:16,000 --> 00:16:16,860
I think

255
00:16:17,900 --> 00:16:20,050
she wouldn't want
to return to the Kuang family.

256
00:16:22,920 --> 00:16:23,760
Miss Mei.

257
00:16:24,560 --> 00:16:25,760
Please take good care of her for me.

258
00:16:26,660 --> 00:16:27,220
Will you?

259
00:16:35,200 --> 00:16:37,720
Have you talked Boss Kuang into it?

260
00:16:37,800 --> 00:16:39,200
Has he agreed to let Yijie stay here?

261
00:16:40,720 --> 00:16:42,520
It doesn't matter whether he agrees.

262
00:16:42,840 --> 00:16:44,240
He has too much to deal with anyway.

263
00:16:59,720 --> 00:17:03,280
Where is everyone?

264
00:17:05,080 --> 00:17:05,760
Boss.

265
00:17:06,160 --> 00:17:07,200
What's going on?

266
00:17:08,400 --> 00:17:10,320
Someone's even taken down
the sign at the entrance.

267
00:17:10,440 --> 00:17:11,600
Why didn't you stop them?

268
00:17:11,920 --> 00:17:13,400
How could we?

269
00:17:13,600 --> 00:17:15,760
Government officials
were leading the demolition.

270
00:17:16,160 --> 00:17:17,280
Government officials?

271
00:17:19,760 --> 00:17:20,600
What about this place?

272
00:17:20,920 --> 00:17:22,040
Did they wreck this too?

273
00:17:22,640 --> 00:17:24,360
Boss, listen to me.

274
00:17:24,720 --> 00:17:27,560
The foreman at the tobacco factory
ran off with the money.

275
00:17:27,800 --> 00:17:29,200
The workers couldn't
collect their wages,

276
00:17:29,320 --> 00:17:32,360
so they took whatever
valuables they could from the shop.

277
00:17:34,160 --> 00:17:34,960
Fine!

278
00:17:36,360 --> 00:17:37,560
Just wonderful!

279
00:17:38,520 --> 00:17:39,720
I don't believe for a second

280
00:17:40,600 --> 00:17:41,840
that the Kuang family is finished

281
00:17:42,360 --> 00:17:43,840
without Lv Mengde!

282
00:17:46,440 --> 00:17:48,600
You, keep an eye on this place.

283
00:17:49,560 --> 00:17:50,720
I'm going to see Boss Ren.

284
00:17:57,160 --> 00:18:00,360
Such a thriving business.

285
00:18:06,880 --> 00:18:08,760
It was such a thriving business.

286
00:18:09,720 --> 00:18:11,560
- What are you doing?
- What are you looking at?

287
00:18:11,560 --> 00:18:14,040
Where's Boss Lv? Get Boss Lv out here!

288
00:18:15,040 --> 00:18:15,440
Boss.

289
00:18:15,560 --> 00:18:17,560
Don't tell me
your boss lady has disappeared too.

290
00:18:18,720 --> 00:18:20,600
Without its boss lady,

291
00:18:21,400 --> 00:18:22,800
is Kaimeili even Kaimeili anymore?

292
00:18:25,320 --> 00:18:26,760
Here's what you owe this month.

293
00:18:36,160 --> 00:18:38,600
We never had
all these ridiculous charges before.

294
00:18:39,040 --> 00:18:40,160
At these rates,

295
00:18:40,640 --> 00:18:42,680
Kaimeili couldn't
earn enough to cover them.

296
00:18:43,240 --> 00:18:44,720
How are we supposed to stay in business?

297
00:18:44,760 --> 00:18:46,000
That was then.

298
00:18:46,160 --> 00:18:47,640
This is now.

299
00:18:49,960 --> 00:18:51,640
Things aren't what they used to be.

300
00:18:52,200 --> 00:18:53,800
If you can't pay today,

301
00:18:54,120 --> 00:18:55,520
you can all get out!

302
00:18:55,960 --> 00:18:57,560
Smash it! Smash everything!

303
00:19:04,000 --> 00:19:05,240
Those who have work, get back to it.

304
00:19:05,240 --> 00:19:06,360
Those rehearsing, keep rehearsing.

305
00:19:06,360 --> 00:19:07,400
I'm still here.

306
00:19:07,720 --> 00:19:09,000
Ever since Boss Lv disappeared,

307
00:19:09,000 --> 00:19:10,400
they've been pushing us around.

308
00:19:10,560 --> 00:19:11,280
What are we going to do?

309
00:19:11,600 --> 00:19:12,880
Fortunes change.

310
00:19:13,600 --> 00:19:14,680
Then let them change.

311
00:19:14,800 --> 00:19:17,840
♪And watch the lights
come on one by one♪

312
00:19:18,400 --> 00:19:21,240
♪Like blades cutting
through the radiance♪

313
00:19:22,000 --> 00:19:24,840
♪You may treat me as dust
beneath your feet♪

314
00:19:24,840 --> 00:19:26,760
♪Or wipe me away like ashes♪

315
00:19:26,760 --> 00:19:28,320
♪Leaving a cold ending♪

316
00:19:28,320 --> 00:19:30,280
♪But I refuse to fall♪

317
00:19:30,280 --> 00:19:35,200
♪I refuse to become a shadow
fading beneath the lights♪

318
00:19:35,320 --> 00:19:37,760
♪I refuse to dissolve into♪

319
00:19:38,840 --> 00:19:41,840
♪The lifeless light of the past♪

320
00:19:42,160 --> 00:19:45,000
♪I want sharpness at my fingertips♪

321
00:19:45,040 --> 00:19:47,840
♪And steps that avoid
the traps among the thorns♪

322
00:19:48,560 --> 00:19:51,440
♪At dawn, I will look
straight into your eyes♪

323
00:19:51,440 --> 00:19:54,640
♪My gaze clear, illuminating the dawn♪

324
00:19:56,120 --> 00:19:58,880
♪Those who have hurt me♪

325
00:19:59,440 --> 00:20:02,120
♪I choose to pierce through♪

326
00:20:03,720 --> 00:20:05,200
♪To tear apart♪

327
00:20:05,320 --> 00:20:11,200
♪To ignite a sacred flame♪

328
00:20:12,880 --> 00:20:15,000
♪I do not pray to the gods♪

329
00:20:15,000 --> 00:20:17,920
♪Nor bow to power♪

330
00:20:17,920 --> 00:20:20,200
♪I will no longer play the tragic lead♪

331
00:20:22,000 --> 00:20:25,920
♪I will stand and carve
the path of my own fate♪
